{"seq":40,"slug":"git-version-control-internals","title":"Git 与版本控制原理","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Git 与版本控制原理\n\n几乎每个程序员每天都在敲 `git commit`、`git push`，却很少有人能讲清楚一次提交在磁盘上究竟变成了什么。这个 hub 的目标，是把 Git 从「一组要背的命令」还原成「一个可以推理的系统」：一旦你理解了底层那张内容寻址的对象图，绝大多数看似古怪的行为——分离 HEAD、变基后丢提交、合并冲突、`git gc` 之后仓库突然变小——都会从「玄学」变成「可预测的因果」。\n\n四个章节按「先建模、再操作、再拆解、再放大」的顺序层层递进，刻意让每一层都站在前一层的肩膀上。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基。它先把 Git 放回版本控制的谱系里，对比集中式与分布式、快照式与差量式两种世界观，再深入 Git 的四种对象（blob、tree、commit、tag）如何用 SHA 哈希构成一张不可变的有向无环图，最后讲清 ref 和分支不过是「指向某个 commit 的一行文本指针」。这一章建立的心智模型，是后面所有内容的词汇表。\n\n第二章「核心操作」把模型用起来。提交如何在对象图上追加节点、历史如何被遍历与改写，合并与变基如何用两种完全不同的方式整合分叉，远程同步又如何在两台机器的对象图之间传递差集。你会看到日常命令其实都是对第一章那张图的增删查改。\n\n第三章「内部机制」拆开引擎盖。packfile 如何用 delta 压缩把成千上万个对象塞进一个文件，diff 与三路合并背后是哪些经典算法（Myers、histogram、递归合并），以及 reflog 这条「本地操作日志」如何成为你误删提交后的救命稻草。这一章解释的是「为什么 Git 又快又省，且几乎总能救回来」。\n\n第四章「工作流与规模」把视角拉到团队与超大仓库。分支策略（trunk-based、GitHub Flow、GitFlow）如何匹配不同的交付节奏，单仓（monorepo）如何靠 partial clone、sparse-checkout 与 Scalar 撑到几十 GB，钩子（hooks）与 CI 又如何把规范自动钉进每一次提交。\n\n读完这四章，你对 Git 的理解会从「记得怎么用」升级为「知道它在干什么、为什么这样设计、出问题时去哪里找」。建议按顺序阅读：跳过第一章直接看变基或 packfile，会缺少推理所需的对象图语言。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vcs-models","title":"版本控制模型","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/foundations/vcs-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"git-object-model","title":"Git 对象模型","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/foundations/git-object-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"refs-branches","title":"引用与分支","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/foundations/refs-branches"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-operations","title":"核心操作","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/core-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"commits-history","title":"提交与历史","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/core-operations/commits-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"merging-rebasing","title":"合并与变基","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/core-operations/merging-rebasing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"remotes-sync","title":"远程与同步","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/core-operations/remotes-sync"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"internals","title":"内部机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/internals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"storage-packfiles","title":"存储与 packfile","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/internals/storage-packfiles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"diff-merge-algorithms","title":"差分与合并算法","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/internals/diff-merge-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reflog-recovery","title":"reflog 与数据恢复","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/internals/reflog-recovery"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"workflows-scale","title":"工作流与规模","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/workflows-scale","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"branching-strategies","title":"分支策略","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/workflows-scale/branching-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"large-repos","title":"大仓库与单仓","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/workflows-scale/large-repos"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hooks-automation","title":"钩子与自动化","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/git-version-control-internals/workflows-scale/hooks-automation"}]}]}